1
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:08,340
With two or more calls up, tick the calls in Active calls and click Merge calls.

2
00:00:08,340 --> 00:00:13,660
They are listed as a conference, and each participant has their own hang-up button.

3
00:00:14,410 --> 00:00:17,571
Leave drops you out while the others stay connected.

4
00:00:17,571 --> 00:00:21,060
End for all ends the call for everyone, after you confirm.

5
00:00:21,810 --> 00:00:26,918
A queue or campaign call puts you in wrap-up until you complete the activity.

6
00:00:26,918 --> 00:00:30,980
A direct call, or a call you dialed yourself, skips wrap-up.

